   "subject": "Omnicomplete in Rmarkdown Coding Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>It is possible to get omnicomplete working inside of Rmarkdown coding chunks? When I press &lt;Ctrl-x&gt; &lt;Ctrl-o&gt; in insert mode, I always get a &quot;Pattern not found&quot; when inside a R coding chunk. </div><div><br></div><div>When inside a regular .R script file, the omnicomplete works just fine. I am using the released version of the Vim-R-plugin (1.2.7).</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Fong</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "e7JICpv6DQAJ",
   "from": "Jakson Alves de Aquino",
   "author": "b256a2742aacd200",
   "date": "2016-02-10T21:39:15Z",
   "subject": "Re: Omnicomplete in Rmarkdown Coding Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">What is the output of<div><br><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>It should be either <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">omnifunc=rcomplete#CompleteR</font><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"> (Vim) or </font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">omnifunc=CompleteR</span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"> (Neovim).</font></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "XgfvMgdwDgAJ",
   "from": "Fong Chun Chan",
   "author": "61221ab1f726dce8",
   "date": "2016-02-12T09:31:03Z",
   "subject": "Re: Omnicomplete in Rmarkdown Coding Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "It&#39;s returning omnifunc=htmlcomplete#CompleteTags. "
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "Zbye0oDsDgAJ",
   "from": "Jakson Alves de Aquino",
   "author": "b256a2742aacd200",
   "date": "2016-02-13T23:32:04Z",
   "subject": "Re: Omnicomplete in Rmarkdown Coding Chunks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The code below in my vimrc solved the problem with rnoweb (I use vimtex):<br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> has</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nvim&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  autocmd </span><span style=\"color:#606\">FileType</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnoweb let b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rplugin_nonr_omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;vimtex#complete#omnifunc&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> setlocal omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">CompleteR</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  autocmd </span><span style=\"color:#606\">FileType</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnoweb let b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rplugin_nonr_omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;vimtex#complete#omnifunc&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> setlocal omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rcomplete</span><span style=\"color:#800\">#CompleteR</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>endif</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>You could try the following in your vimrc:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> has</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nvim&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  autocmd </span><span style=\"color:#606\">FileType</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rmd let b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rplugin_nonr_omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">htmlcomplete#CompleteTags</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">|</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> setlocal omnifunc</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,0,102)\">CompleteR</span></div><div><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  autocmd </span><span style=\"color:#606\">FileType</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rmd let b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rplugin_nonr_omnifunc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">htmlcomplete#CompleteTags</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">|</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> setlocal omnifunc</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rcomplete</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#CompleteR</span></div><div><span style=\"color:#000\">endif</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>This way you should get html completion outside R chunks and R completion inside them.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
